  "query_preview": "..\n(Wednesday through Saturday)\nIssued at 201 AM CDT Sun Jul 26 2026\n\nThe upper ridge will continue to expand westward through the latter \nhalf of the upcoming week with the heat dome continuing to provide \nwidespread triple digit heat. Several shortwaves will pass to the \nnorth of the ridge and being on the eastern periphery, northwesterly \nflow in combination with the shortwaves may bring chances for \nprecipitation to portions of northern Oklahoma. By Friday, the upper \nridge will continue to retrograde westward into the Desert Southwest \nwith a stronger shortwave diving southward across the Central Plains \nbringing a front through the forecast area Friday. Sadly this front \nwill only bring little relief to the temperatures with triple digit \nheat still possible.",
